        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself from bees!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excellent for retro game fans! -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like games with the nostalgic look of 8-bit consoles, this game is for you. Designed to present an experience reminiscent of the old days.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely hand-drawn with zero artificial intelligence! -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail was designed by the creator without the use of artificial intelligence. We're not against AI, but if you value something created from scratch by a human, including the sounds and music, and completely original, here you'll find it all.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by appearances -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the protagonist seems cute... he's grumpy and an expert at solving puzzles and mazes. He enjoys challenges like this, where you might be surprised by the level of difficulty and time constraints.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down puzzle adventure that will make you think a lot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of the special launch price!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself from bees!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excellent for retro game fans! -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like games with the nostalgic look of 8-bit consoles, this game is for you. Designed to present an experience reminiscent of the old days.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely hand-drawn with zero artificial intelligence! -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail was designed by the creator without the use of artificial intelligence. We're not against AI, but if you value something created from scratch by a human, including the sounds and music, and completely original, here you'll find it all.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by appearances -</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the protagonist seems cute... he's grumpy and an expert at solving puzzles and mazes. He enjoys challenges like this, where you might be surprised by the level of difficulty and time constraints.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top-down puzzle adventure that will make you think a lot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of the special launch price!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Help a grumpy bear get out of the wild mazes while filling his belly with honey.",
